# Technical Roadmap of Foundation Models

## 1. Overview

This roadmap provides an overview of the development and evolution of large foundation models and related technologies that contribute to the advancement of autonomous driving question answering (QA).

It summarizes representative milestones in the development of large language models (LLMs), vision-language models (VLMs), multimodal large language models (MLLMs), world models (WMs), and diffusion models (DMs). These models and technologies provide important foundations for multimodal perception, semantic understanding, reasoning, prediction, and decision-making in autonomous driving systems.

The roadmap is organized chronologically to illustrate the evolution of these models and highlight the technological progress that has influenced the development of large foundation models for autonomous driving.

