## 4. Notes

- The roadmap highlights representative milestones rather than providing an exhaustive list of all foundation models.
- The categories are organized according to the primary model architectures or technological paradigms discussed in the corresponding publications.
- The publication year should be interpreted consistently, preferably based on the first public release of the corresponding paper.
- The BibTeX keys are provided for reference management and citation purposes. Please refer to the original publications for complete bibliographic information.

